    "title": "Men's and Women's Swimming Set for Season Opener in Salem Relay Meet - NewsBreak",
    "text": "1 days ago The Wheeling University Men's and Women's Swimming team open their account for the 2026/27 campaign on Saturday, as they make the short trip over to Salem, W.Va for a relay meet. It will be a first for the Swimming program under Will Hughes, with the relay meet a good chance for newcomers to get competitive reps under their belt with their new teammates. Read full article",
